 "circuits": [
  {
   "id": "dual-port-automotive",
   "title": "Dual-port automotive USB charger",
   "page": 1,
   "description": "Two USB ports fed from a 5 V DC-DC converter. A TPS2561A-Q1 dual power switch delivers VBUS to each connector, its two enables driven by control signals and its two fault outputs pulled up to 5 V; RILIM on ILIM sets its current limit. The TPS2513A-Q1, supplied from the same 5 V rail, connects to D- and D+ of both connectors and presents the charging signature. Each VBUS has a bulk capacitor CUSB to ground, the 5 V rail has COUT and a 0.1 µF capacitor at the switch input.",
