   "id": "dual-port",
   "title": "Dual-port charger",
   "page": 12,
   "description": "A power supply rail feeds a TPS2561A-Q1 dual power switch and the TPS2513A-Q1, with a 0.1 µF capacitor from the rail to ground at the controller. OUT1 and OUT2 of the switch carry VBUS to connector 2 and connector 1, each with a capacitor to ground; RILIM to ground sets the switch current limit. DM1 and DP1 go to D- and D+ of connector 1, DM2 and DP2 to those of connector 2. With the TPS2561A-Q1 limit above 2.4 A per channel, both ports can fast-charge devices that use Divider 3, 1.2 V or BC1.2 short mode.",
